OL,3,GNEWSACouncil estate redevelopment plans
OL,4,Ato go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 134 homes on the site of
OL,7,Fa near-empty housing estate have been
OL,8,Funanimously approved by councillors.
OL,10,FCambridge City Council gave permission
OL,11,Ffor the Cambridge Investment
OL,12,FPartnership's redevelopment of the Ekin
OL,13,FRoad estate at a meeting on Wednesday.
OL,15,FIn 2024, it gave the authority for the
OL,16,Fmajority of existing homes, many of
OL,17,Fwhich are boarded up, to be demolished.
OL,19,FA report said the redevelopment would
OL,20,F"replace ageing housing stock that is
OL,21,Faffected by significant damp, mould and
OL,22,Fstructural issues".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
